  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">23-0000794 _This Policy Support Fund  (PSF) is financing small activities in support of the Health and SRHR portfolio of the Netherl ands Embassy in A</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">23-0000794_The objective of this Policy Support Fund (PSF) is to finance small activities that increase the effectiveness of the Health and SRHR portfolio of the Embassy of the Kingdom of the Netherlands in Ethiopia (EKN). Potential activities are either aimed at increasing the coherence of the portfolio as a whole or at the  design, effectiveness and efficiency of individual activities. This may include for example learning events, due diligence procedures, organizational support and evaluations. This Bemo serves as a collective Bemo funded by the SRHR budget, and will serve until the end of this MACS-period as an umbrella fund center, under which different small scale activities will be committed.</narrative>
  </description>
